/delivery/*
# 发布说明是发布记录的一部分（AppChangelog 与更新日志检查都要能查到），必须入库；
# 旁边同目录的 APK / build.json 仍属构建产物，继续忽略。
!/delivery/release-*.md
# The update manifest and its landing page are source for the release channel; the packages
# beside them are build output and stay out of the repository.
!/delivery/update/
/delivery/update/*.apk
